{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>EXPLORE DANGEROUS AREAS, DEFEAT ENEMIES, AND RECOVER THE TRI-CRYSTAL BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/79dacdbfed0c1e0539f853356a7e18ac.poster.avif?t=1772125315\" width=480 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/79dacdbfed0c1e0539f853356a7e18ac.webm?t=1772125315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/79dacdbfed0c1e0539f853356a7e18ac.mp4?t=1772125315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bobble and the Tri-Crystal is a 2D side-scrolling shoot 'em up, inspired by retro handheld consoles. You will face stages where you must reach the end while dodging enemy attacks!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the ocean and play as Bobble, a detective fish, to stop the escaped prisoners before they get their hands on the Tri-Crystal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/ec8b9e8cf68c091f484b15f127ee9de7.avif?t=1772125315\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also face  bosses: prisoners who escaped to unlock their true potential with the Tri-Crystal! Learn their patterns, dodge their attacks, and shoot them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/1a74af4a5370f8f36dac57dff944f3da.poster.avif?t=1772125315\" width=480 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/1a74af4a5370f8f36dac57dff944f3da.webm?t=1772125315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/1a74af4a5370f8f36dac57dff944f3da.mp4?t=1772125315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies earns you<i>\u00a0Hero Credits</i>, which can be used to purchase new skills from the shop! Enter a level with two weapons at once, and press a button to switch between them!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/extras/45ce8df5e9e7375a29196184fb1c9d4d.avif?t=1772125315\" width=476 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u>:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 levels with memorable boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 distinct weapons to make every playthrough unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting story with a big cast of characters and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics based on old handheld games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for newcomers to Shmups/Shoot 'Em Ups.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077920?t=1772125315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/1b27c6b67c9b12818f511816f8cf46c2caeb9861/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772125315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077920/1a8b458ebbf3e9a467e9d6675e4c7557577c1701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772125315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.a